---
// ValueProps.astro - Why Just Screw It? value propositions
---

<section id="over-ons" class="section-padding">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6">
    <!-- Section header -->
    <div class="text-center mb-16 animate-fade-in-up">
      <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-heading font-black uppercase text-white">
        Waarom Just Screw It?
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-muted max-w-xl mx-auto">
        Geen gedoe. Geen minimum tempo. Geen matching outfits. Gewoon lopen.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Cards grid -->
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
      <!-- Card 1: Geen Oordeel -->
      <div class="glass-card p-8 text-center animate-fade-in-up animate-delay-100">
        <div class="flex justify-center mb-6">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="48" height="48" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="text-primary-light">
            <path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"></path>
            <polyline points="9 12 11 14 15 10"></polyline>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-heading font-bold uppercase text-white mb-3">Geen Oordeel</h3>
        <p class="text-muted leading-relaxed">
          Of je nu 4 min/km loopt of 8 — het maakt ons niet uit. Zolang je niet op de bank ligt te scrollen naar hardloopvideo's. Dat telt niet.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 2: Alle Niveaus -->
      <div class="glass-card p-8 text-center animate-fade-in-up animate-delay-200">
        <div class="flex justify-center mb-6">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="48" height="48" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="text-primary-light">
            <path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"></path>
            <circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"></circle>
            <path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"></path>
            <path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-heading font-bold uppercase text-white mb-3">Alle Niveaus</h3>
        <p class="text-muted leading-relaxed">
          Van "ik-word-al-moe-van-de-trap" tot marathon-veteraan. We hebben tempogroepen voor iedereen. Ja, ook voor jou.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 3: Echte Community -->
      <div class="glass-card p-8 text-center animate-fade-in-up animate-delay-300">
        <div class="flex justify-center mb-6">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="48" height="48" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="text-primary-light">
            <path d="M20.84 4.61a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.78 0L12 5.67l-1.06-1.06a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.78 7.78l1.06 1.06L12 21.23l7.78-7.78 1.06-1.06a5.5 5.5 0 0 0 0-7.78z"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-heading font-bold uppercase text-white mb-3">Echte Community</h3>
        <p class="text-muted leading-relaxed">
          Na het lopen: koffie, slechte grappen, en mensen die oprecht blij zijn dat je kwam opdagen. De koffie is optioneel. De slechte grappen niet.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
